    description: Some("The 64K cartridge packed with Dynacom\'s MegaBoy, a handheld Atari 2600 clone sold in Brazil as a children\'s learning machine. It is a menu rather than a game: arithmetic and English drills, music, and a set of small games. At 64K it is the largest 2600 cartridge known."),
